script: Temporal.Duration.from({years: 1}).round({smallestUnit: "month", largestUnit: "year", roundingMode: "halfExpand", relativeTo: new Temporal.PlainDate(2020, 1, 1)}).toString()
note: row D6: round with a plain-date relativeTo (nudging, bubbling, weeks, increments, negative, the limits); ComputeNudgeWindow's r1 = 0 test, read literally, would answer str:"P1Y1M": JSD-0054 section 4's defect of the text, which the polyfill and both engines do not follow
