id: temporal/rounding/4586
area: temporal
op: Temporal.Duration.prototype.round, toString
in: str:"months" int:10 str:"days" int:29 str:"month" str:"year" undefined str:"ceil" int:2019 int:3 int:31
out: value: str:"P11M"
class: divergence
divergence.broiler-js: row D7: rounding to months relative to a plain date whose destination lies past the first window re-derives through a clamped difference (row D6's path), so {months: 10, days: 29, hours: 12} from 2019-03-31 is P10M29D, where the pinned text answers P11M (decision D7); correction, answered by SJL-10.5
prov: proposal:temporal@e8cc03fc#sec-temporal.duration.prototype.round proposal:temporal@e8cc03fc#sec-temporal-roundrelativeduration ref:temporalref@1
script: Temporal.Duration.from({months: 10, days: 29}).round({smallestUnit: "month", largestUnit: "year", roundingMode: "ceil", relativeTo: new Temporal.PlainDate(2019, 3, 31)}).toString()
note: rows D7 and D8: from 2019-03-31 the destination lies past the first month window and inside the shifted one; rounded to months, the destination at the shifted window's start, ceil
since: 24

id: temporal/rounding/4587
